{{Quote|Featuring a high collar scientifically designed to deflect mud, blood, and indirect non-lethal projectiles, this pristine armor bestows the authority to overcome close-quarters combat through a time-honored tradition: the delegation—or court-martialing—of subordinates.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page 2 of the [[Entrenched Division Premium Warbond|Entrenched Division]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

